message: Please cite the paper; this distribution supplies its source and finite checks.
type: software
title: 'A beginning is worth one limit: robust unlearnable laws in noisy cellular automata'
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-10-29'
license:
- CC-BY-4.0
- MIT
